  - speakerName: 'Jim:'
    line: "\u201CWish I did. Last time he brought in a catch, he was mutterin\u2019
      about \u2018findin\u2019 the mouth of the deep.\u2019 Gave me the chills, to
      be honest. But no\u2014he never said where he was headed. Just smiled that
      smile of his and wandered off, lookin\u2019 like a man with a secret.\u201D"
